  {
    "text": "So if mankind has gone through something of a fall or of a descent, we're moving further away from this principal unity. We're moving further away from essence or quality.",
    "author": "Mario Garza",
    "portrait": ""
  },
  {
    "text": "The quantitative is the illusory. Which is why as it becomes more and more prominent as the lens through which people see reality, people become more and more divorced from the truth.",
    "author": "Chance Garton",
