  },
  {
    "text": "There wasn't anything that you put in your body. There wasn't anything that you wore. There wasn't anything in your immediate vicinity that was basically anonymously created.",
    "author": "Mario Garza",
    "portrait": ""
  },
  {
    "text": "I thank God for every day that my life gets to be the vocational expression of doing what I feel like I'm here to do.",
    "author": "Chance Garton",
    "portrait": "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/5987d897cf81e0278ec5322e/a784fd99-3e6f-436c-a8f3-c4f913b855ed/profile-pic.jpg?content-type=image%2Fjpeg"
  },
  {
    "text": "So the person who's only thinking in quantitative purchasing power terms, that's how they walk through life and that's how they see everything.",
    "author": "Mario Garza",
    "portrait": ""
  },
  {
    "text": "I have had experiences where time not only expanded or contracted, but actually paused. I have exited time before.",
    "author": "Chance Garton",
