  },
  {
    "text": "So to stop a nomadic person from traveling is basically like putting them in prison.",
    "author": "Mario Garza",
    "portrait": ""
  },
  {
    "text": "Communism had this promise of the workers utopia and that, you know, resources and wealth would be equally distributed and there would be this quantitative uniformity for everyone, and everyone starved.",
    "author": "Chance Garton",
